        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA Home That Truly Surprises You.\n\nFrom the outside, this wonderful family home may not reveal everything it has to offer but step through the front door and you are immediately met with a completely different feel. Bright, welcoming and filled with natural light, this impressive five bedroom, three bathroom residence in the peaceful surroundings of Clonnasheeoge, Ballymurn, County Wexford, is a home that deserves to be experienced.\n\nFrom the moment you enter, the bright reception space creates a warm and inviting first impression, leading through to the heart of the home a beautifully presented, contemporary open-plan kitchen and dining area.\n\nHere, natural light floods the space, highlighting the neutral tiled flooring, recessed lighting and modern finishes. At the centre of the kitchen sits a superb island, creating a wonderful focal point and, more importantly, a space where family life can happen naturally. Whether enjoying breakfast together before the day begins, preparing dinner in the evening or simply gathering around the island for a chat, this is a kitchen designed for connection.\n\nThe modern kitchen is complemented by a dedicated utility room, providing the practical space every busy family home needs.\n\nThe layout of the ground floor has been thoughtfully designed to offer both togetherness and privacy. To one side of the home accommodates three well-proportioned bedrooms. One of these bedrooms benefits from its own ensuite, while the main family bathroom is also conveniently positioned on this level.\n\nAnd then there is upstairs.\n\nTwo generous bedrooms occupy the first floor, both beautifully bright thanks to the abundance of natural light. One enjoys the added luxury of its own ensuite, creating an ideal private space for older children, guests or simply those looking for a little more privacy.\n\nWith five bedrooms and three bathrooms, there is an abundance of flexibility throughout the home, whether you are looking for space for a growing family, somewhere for guests to stay or simply room to enjoy the freedom that a larger home provides.\n\nOutside, the property continues to impress. The gorgeous front and rear gardens complement the home beautifully, offering lovely outdoor spaces for gatherings, summer evenings or simply enjoying the peace and tranquillity of this attractive location.\n\nSet within the lovely surroundings of Clonnasheeoge, Ballymurn with proximity to wexford beaches & county amenities including schools, GAA clubs and more. Wexford town is approximately 15minutes by car. \n\nA home with room to grow, room to entertain and room to make memories, this is a wonderful opportunity for a buyer looking for the perfect family home in a peaceful Wexford setting.\n\nVirtual tour online.\n\nViewing by apppointment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 2.85m x 3.68m\nSpacious entrance hall, cream tiled flooring.\n\nHallway - 7.45m x 2.77m\nrecessed lighting, tiled flooring.\n\nReception Room - 4.26m 4.58m\nNatural light feeds the reception room, open fireplace, tiled flooring.\n\nKitchen - 4.26m x 5.16m\nSpacious kitchen/ dining area, opened planned, fully fitted kitchen, island, contemporary design, natural light engulfs the room, tiled flooring.\n\nDining Area - 3.23m x 4.08m\nDouble door to rear garden.\n\nUtility Room - 2.06m x 2.34m\nTiled flooring, access to rear garden.\n\nBedroom 1. - 3.20m x 3.68m\nNice proportion bedroom, tiled flooring.\n\nBathroom - 2.43m x 2.29m\nw.c , w.h.b. , shower, tiled flooring.\n\nBedroom 2. - 3.66m x 3.68m\nLovely second bedroom, tiled flooring.\n\nBedroom 3. - 4.24m x 4.08m\nSpacious third bedroom complemented with an ensuite bathroom, tiled flooring.\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 2.43m x 2.29m\nw.c , w.h.b. , shower.\n\nFirst Flr. - \n\n\nLanding - 3.67m x 2.56m\nCarpet to floor.\n\nBedroom 4. - 4.74m x 4.45m\nFabulous forth bedroom, carpet to floor, skylight.\n\nBedroom 5. - 4.16m x 7.53m\nAnother fabulous spacious fifth bedroom, skylight, carpet to floor, complemented with an ensuite.\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 3.62m x 2.08m\nw.c , w.h.b. , bath, tiled flooring\n\n"
